    {
      "field": "text_78",
      "shape_id": 78,
      "shape_name": "文本框 77",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 86,
      "source_sample_chars": 43,
      "source_text": "市场调研：收集客户需求，分析竞品，输出报告。\n概念定义：明确定位，完成功能定义和方案。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        308.6,
        120.5,
        146.8,
        83.3
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_83",
      "shape_id": 83,
      "shape_name": "文本框 82",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 76,
      "source_sample_chars": 38,
      "source_text": "样品开发：完成打样，进行内部测试。\n用户试用：组织试用，收集反馈并进行优化。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        463.8,
        120.5,
        146.8,
        83.3
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_84",
      "shape_id": 84,
      "shape_name": "文本框 83",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 74,
      "source_sample_chars": 37,
      "source_text": "包装设计：完成包装、说明书的设计。\n销售工具：制作营销手册，完成员工培训。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        619.0,
        120.5,
        146.8,
        83.3
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_85",
      "shape_id": 85,
      "shape_name": "文本框 84",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 74,
      "source_sample_chars": 37,
      "source_text": "活动执行：策划发布会，并正式发布新品。\n数据跟踪：跟进销售数据，调整策略。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        774.2,
        120.5,
        146.8,
        83.3
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_86",
      "shape_id": 86,
      "shape_name": "文本框 85",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 84,
      "source_sample_chars": 42,
      "source_text": "流程梳理：调研各工作环节绘制项目精度流程图。\n痛点识别：分析客户投诉，梳理服务瓶颈。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        308.6,
        268.2,
        146.8,
        83.3
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_87",
      "shape_id": 87,
      "shape_name": "文本框 86",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 78,
      "source_sample_chars": 39,
      "source_text": "新流程设计：优化工作流程明确项目标准。\n方案评审：组织专家评审，确认项目方案。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        463.8,
        268.2,
        146.8,
        83.3
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_88",
      "shape_id": 88,
      "shape_name": "文本框 87",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 74,
      "source_sample_chars": 37,
      "source_text": "试点选择：选取对应部门进行试运行。\n效果评估：收集运行反馈，进行优化调整。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        619.0,
        268.2,
        146.8,
        83.3
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_89",
      "shape_id": 89,
      "shape_name": "文本框 88",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 82,
      "source_sample_chars": 41,
      "source_text": "全员培训：组织专业培训，确保顾客服务体验。\n持续监控：建立监控机制，后续评估改进。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        774.2,
        268.2,
        146.8,
        83.3
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_90",
      "shape_id": 90,
      "shape_name": "文本框 89",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 76,
      "source_sample_chars": 38,
      "source_text": "目标定位：确定产品的目标和受众人群。\n方案设计：策划营销形式，完成营销方案。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        308.6,
        411.5,
        146.8,
        83.3
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_91",
      "shape_id": 91,
      "shape_name": "文本框 90",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 74,
      "source_sample_chars": 37,
      "source_text": "物料制作：完成营销物料的设计与制作。\n预热宣传：多渠道预热，提升宣传效果。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        463.8,
        411.5,
