        83.3
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_92",
      "shape_id": 92,
      "shape_name": "文本框 91",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 86,
      "source_sample_chars": 43,
      "source_text": "现场组织：完成布置分工，确保物料准备到位。\n应急处理：建立应急预案，及时处理突发事件。",
      "bounds_pt": [
        619.0,
        411.5,
        146.8,
        83.3
      ],
      "semantic_role": "provisional"
    },
    {
      "field": "text_93",
      "shape_id": 93,
      "shape_name": "文本框 92",
      "type": "text",
      "max_chars": 70,
      "source_sample_chars": 35,
      "source_text": "数据分析：统计营销效果，分析产出。\n复盘输出：总结经验，形成项目报告。",
      "bounds_pt": [
